1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,320
Track 5.3 Unit 5 Language in use Activity 1
Bài 5.3 Đơn vị 5 Ngôn ngữ sử dụng Bài tập 1

2
00:00:07,040 --> 00:00:10,080
What did Ella do at her party?
Ella đã làm gì ở tiệc sinh nhật?

3
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:12,480
Listen and tick
Nghe và đánh dấu tích

4
00:00:13,439 --> 00:00:18,160
Look at this photo of my birthday party!
Nhìn tấm ảnh tiệc sinh nhật của mình này!

5
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:22,559
Wow! Did you dress up as a leopard?
Wow! Bạn hóa trang thành con báo à?

6
00:00:22,800 --> 00:00:27,519
No, I didn't. I was a lion.
Không. Mình là con sư tử.

7
00:00:27,839 --> 00:00:32,880
Oh, OK. Did you dance with your friends?
Ồ, OK. Bạn có nhảy với bạn bè không?

8
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:38,719
Yes, I did. My grandma played the piano.
Có. Bà mình chơi piano.

9
00:00:39,039 --> 00:00:42,480
Great! Did you eat pizza?
Tuyệt! Bạn có ăn pizza không?

10
00:00:42,960 --> 00:00:50,960
Yes, I did. There was lots of cheese on it. It was delicious.
Có. Có rất nhiều phô mai trên đó. Rất ngon.

11
00:00:51,280 --> 00:00:53,280
Did you play with dolls?
Bạn có chơi búp bê không?

12
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:58,240
No, I didn't. We didn't have time.
Không. Bọn mình không có thời gian.

13
00:00:58,480 --> 00:00:59,280
Oh.
Ồ.

